Remix IDE:
==========
Online IDE for writing a single smart contract, compiling, deploying and testing.
Basically good for learning solidity and doing rapid prototyping.


Hardhat & Truffle:
==================
They are local smart contract development framework for writing, compiling, testing, deploying, debugging. 
When we are working for companies or build even a complex smart contracts in a project based format then we use these tools.
industry-standard frameworks for building and managing production-grade smart contract projects.



